## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (1)
- `GET /users/sign_in` — Sign in to the HackerOne platform.

### Data Read (6)
- `GET /{id}` — Retrieve a specific resource by ID.
- `GET /api/public/v1/{v1Id}` — Retrieve a resource using a v1 ID.
- `GET /programs/{programId}` — Retrieve details for a specific program.
- `GET /user-guide/general` — Read general user guide information.
- `GET /utils/countries` — Get a list of supported countries.
- `GET /v3/company/details` — Get company details.

### Data Write (3)
- `POST /{id}` — Create or update a resource by ID.
- `POST /api/26/envelope/` — Send an envelope (likely for reporting).
- `POST /com.snowplowanalytics.snowplow/tp2` — Send tracking data to Snowplow.

### Config (2)
- `GET /featured_collections/{featured_collectionId}/promoted_engagements.json` — Get promoted engagements for a collection.
- `POST /flags/` — Set a flag (likely configuration).

